ORDERS ["Take the first upgrade offer: Pan Like a Legend.","Keep the hero and prospector together; kite west-edge claim-jumpers away from the boiler-house site and avoid cliff faces.","Hold the existing palisade at (6,12); prioritize steam wreckers, then coal thieves, then rail toughs.","Pan the active gold seam at (18,25) until funds permit construction.","At 10g, build a second palisade on the western switchback approach without blocking the future ore-cart route.","At 25g, build a sentry beacon covering the claim and western switchback.","At 50g, build a turret on a T2/T3 pad with clear line of sight over the rail cut.","At 70g, build the boiler house at the marked site (0,12), then harvest the north coal seams.","Keep pressure in the working band, 25–80; stop coal feed before exceeding 80 unless an immediate powered attack justifies the vent risk.","Before Railhead Escort, clear the trestle route, reinforce both approaches with palisades, and keep the hero alongside the ore cart."]
