ORDERS ["Take Pan Like a Legend.","Defend the claim and palisade from the active west-side wreckers; fight with the rig while staying out of the flooded gallery.","When the field is clear, pan the active gold seam at (18,25), then the seam at (-10,29).","Save the first 25 gold and build a sentry beacon covering the western switchback approach.","Afterward, save 70 gold and build the boiler house at the marked site (0,12); do not spend coal until pressure infrastructure is online."]
