ORDERS ["Take the first upgrade offer: Pan Like a Legend.","Hold the west switchback near the claim; keep cliff bands between the hero and enemies, and use the rig blast whenever ready on the largest wrecker cluster.","Protect the prospector and existing palisade; intercept steam wreckers before chasing coal thieves or stragglers.","Pan the nearest active gold seam between attacks until 50g is available.","At 50g, build the first turret on the highest legal terrace with line of sight over the west switchback and rail cut.","After the turret, build palisades at the switchback to force climbers through its firing lane.","Do not build a boiler house until coal can be gathered safely and the immediate wave defense is stable.","Keep at least 25g in reserve after wave 2 for a sentry beacon at the rail approach before the escort begins."]
