ORDERS ["Take Pan Like a Legend immediately (first-offer rule).","Hold the hero and prospector near the claim at (0,12); focus fire steam wreckers before other threats.","Protect the surviving palisade at (6,12); do not build while gold is 0.","After the west pack breaks, move to the active seam at (18,25) and pan until enough gold is banked for a turret.","Build the first turret on the highest legal terrace with line of sight over the west switchback and rail cut.","Then save 70g for a boiler house at the marked site (0,12); harvest the northern coal seams to establish working pressure.","Keep the trestle route clear for the Railhead Escort; prioritize any enemy threatening the ore cart."]
